m Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Haunted_Halls_of_Eveningstar\" title=\"The Haunted Halls of Eveningstar\">The Haunted Halls of Eveningstar</a></b>, On the ground near Doppleganger's chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Electric_Resistance\" title=\"Electric Resistance\">Electric Resistance +100</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Electric_Resistance\" title=\"Electric Resistance\">Electric Resistance +100</a>:</b> Passive: +100 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to your Electric Resistance.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Striding\" title=\"Striding\">Striding +30%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Striding\" title=\"Striding\">Striding +30%</a>:</b> This item makes you more fleet of foot, giving you a 30% Enhancement bonus your movement speed.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Grounded\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grounded\">Grounded</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Grounded\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grounded\">Grounded</a>:</b> You are grounded. You cannot jump.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Boots_of_Grounding.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Boots_of_Grounding.png/420px-Boots_of_Grounding.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"281\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Boots_of_Grounding.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>These copper-plated boots were developed to protect the wearer from sudden lightning storms.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>This item is marked \"Epic Normal\", regardless of difficulty the quest is run on.\n</p><p>These boots are useful in the fight against a later quest boss, <a href=\"/page/Miior\" title=\"Miior\">Miior</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816222216\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.124 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2657/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19140/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4741/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n128.13%  137.311     37 Template:IO\n100.00%  107.166      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  107.166      1 -total\n 95.66%  102.512      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 45.76%   49.036      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 44.50%   47.687      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 42.65%   45.708      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 40.09%   42.967      2 Template:InCategory\n 19.77%   21.190      5 Template:Popup\n 18.00%   19.287      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:44340-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816222216 and revision id 628670. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
